meta {
  name: Get Active QR Code
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/lend/qr
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Active QR Code

  This request is used to get active qr code. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — lend qr code fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "lend qr code fetched",
    "data": {
      "id": "d8b5d4cc-805d-3303-3966-dc767c062d27",
      "lend_qr_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/gudangku-94edc.appspot.com/o/lend%2F...",
      "qr_period": 2,
      "created_at": "2024-03-19 02:37:58",
      "lend_desc": "lorem ipsum",
      "lend_expired_datetime": "2024-03-19 04:37:58",
      "is_expired": false
    }
  }
```

  **400 — qr is code is exist but expired**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "lend qr code is expired"
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — lend qr code failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "lend qr code not found"
  }
```

  **422 — qr is code cant generated due to empty inventory**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you must have at least one inventory to generate QR"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}